From 74ba6f7c67feda60b54f11c3e5f48c0a6d5e8c58 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@aol.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:26:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 43/55] steam.exe: Drop a dead jsoncpp include that makedep
 cannot resolve.

The include sits in a !JSON_IS_AMALGAMATION block of the amalgamated source; makedep
does not evaluate conditionals and fails the configure step on it.
---
 configure                      |   3 +-
 configure.ac                   |   1 -
 dlls/kernelbase/Makefile.in    |   2 +-
 dlls/lsteamclient/Makefile.in  | 146 ++++++++++++++++-----------------
 dlls/ntdll/Makefile.in         |   4 +-
 programs/steam.exe/jsoncpp.cpp |   2 -
 server/Makefile.in             |   2 +-
 7 files changed, 78 insertions(+), 82 deletions(-)

